asurer - taxes' 46,451,351 plus other state receipts 75,590 equals the p4 General Fund property/motor vehicle/public power taxes 46,526,941. Student Fees salaries budget 90,000 and Employee Benefits/other budgets as printed. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
